===Etymology===
Possibly borrowed from {{bor|ru|zlw-ocs|zpósob}} (whence {{cog|cs|způsob}}), from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*sъposobъ}} (itself from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*sъ}} + {{der|ru|sla-pro|*posobiti}}.) Cognate with {{cog|uk|спо́сіб}}, {{cog|be|спо́саб}},  {{cog|sk|spôsob}}, {{cog|pl|sposób}}, {{cog|bg|спо́соб}}.

